    "created_at": "2020-06-03T14:54:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-06-03T14:54:04Z",
    "body": "I really like this and I hope other implementers will support it.\r\n\r\n#5574 by @noamr seems relevant here. We probably want to reconcile things somewhat.\r\n\r\nI was initially thinking that we should name these after naturalWidth and naturalHeight, but since those have shortcomings as identified in #3510 perhaps the way forward is to add intrinsicWidth/Height in due course that would capture those semantics properly.\r\n\r\nI think we should probably not expose these for opaque response images though as that would give additional same-origin policy violations. I guess that's also an issue with `image-orientation` and maybe that should also not work for such images.",
